==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A level 20+10 [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] can solo this stage with all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], but there are many other options as well. If your [[Treasure]]s are insufficient, it is recommended to use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] on I.M Phace after beating Elizabeth with Jamiera.

